                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">Is oral surgery different from other sleep apnea surgery?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Oral surgeons specialize in jaw and facial bone surgery. MMA is an oral surgery procedure that permanently enlarges the airway by moving the jaws forward.</div></details>
