                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">How long is recovery from oral surgery?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Soft tissue oral surgery: 2-3 weeks. MMA: 6-8 weeks with liquid diet initially. Most patients return to work within 2-4 weeks.</div></details>
